      "content": "it's not just a \"state\" though. the reputation is gone. permanently. i can't go back to my old life, i can't even look at my old colleagues without feeling sick. it feels like the version of me that mattered was erased, and what's left is just this... wreckage. how am i supposed to just \"navigate\" through a world where i don't even exist anymore?",
