    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about the crisis lines, i've heard it all before. but they don't change the fact that the world has already moved on and decided who i am. it feels more like i'm a ghost haunting a life that isn't mine anymore. like, if everyone who knew me has already turned their back, isn't there just a weird kind of peace in finally acknowledging that the person i used to be is truly gone?",
